  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi></math> and <math><mi>γ</mi></math> be the roots of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, where <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to (where <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>⋅</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer function)"
